{"schemaVersion":1,"topic":"IANA","sources":[{"id":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","kind":"web","ref":{"kind":"web","sourceId":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","revision":1},"questionKeys":["q1"],"title":"Internet Assigned Numbers Authority","url":"https://www.iana.org/","canonical":"https://www.iana.org/","contentHash":"81b0bb6cbb2631c03aaa95c60efc27e88afbaba7c230e901531e785f0716824b","fetchedAt":1793706924786,"publishedAt":null,"status":"ready","excluded":false,"error":null,"truncated":false},{"id":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","kind":"web","ref":{"kind":"web","sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","revision":1},"questionKeys":["q1"],"title":"什么是 IANA：互联网号码分配机构 - LARUS","url":"https://larus.net/cn/blog/what-is-iana/","canonical":"https://larus.net/cn/blog/what-is-iana/","contentHash":"8695605b076e8e7ac91cf27ab5c9170cde13bd63b0abf9bc3182bdbd1ad6a666","fetchedAt":1793706936581,"publishedAt":1787040946000,"status":"ready","excluded":false,"error":null,"truncated":false}],"findings":[{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"Management of the DNS Root Zone (assignments of ccTLDs and gTLDs) along with other functions such as the .int and .arpa zones.","id":"01a1a144-0ef6-7bac-a232-8f0c4f528915","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","quote":"Management of the DNS Root Zone (assignments of ccTLDs and gTLDs) along with other functions such as the .int and .arpa zones.","start":14,"end":140,"quoteHash":"1bb3636e3a168475535b256325b2d0cc9b464ae1feac15b7282f9f9773622ee3"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"IP Addresses & AS Numbers","id":"01a1a144-0ef6-7a88-8d92-b537bc8eb3b6","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","quote":"IP Addresses & AS Numbers","start":381,"end":406,"quoteHash":"2604d9e90887690d7f6e7a7faef939b97134a9445e6a3c9788fc884cb0657fb1"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"The central repository for protocol name and number registries used in many Internet protocols.","id":"01a1a144-0ef6-790d-9393-cc51bfba7818","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","quote":"The central repository for protocol name and number registries used in many Internet protocols.","start":457,"end":552,"quoteHash":"7c83c2e95efd13ed8aec627bba25c33ef2879b6e5738913c1ace196df0a74c19"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"Time Zone Database","id":"01a1a144-0ef7-7601-afe3-995c1e59b804","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9823-7ef9-8a11-7576ed59bd84","quote":"Time Zone Database","start":600,"end":618,"quoteHash":"5fde3dbb62fb08d138ebe509c294c9236ad8eb1080de70bcfaf8cb516b86ac77"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"互联网由各自独立的网络组成，却需要使用同一套名称、号码和协议标识。IANA 负责协调这些标识，让不同网络能够准确地识别彼此。对 ISP、云平台和托管服务商来说，这套共同记录是客户连接的基础；真正把地址接入网络、把服务交付给客户，则是运营商和地址供应商的工作。","id":"01a1a144-0f0f-714c-8fb9-38c3aa2a27b0","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"互联网由各自独立的网络组成，却需要使用同一套名称、号码和协议标识。IANA 负责协调这些标识，让不同网络能够准确地识别彼此。对 ISP、云平台和托管服务商来说，这套共同记录是客户连接的基础；真正把地址接入网络、把服务交付给客户，则是运营商和地址供应商的工作。","start":8,"end":137,"quoteHash":"d11c98b0e44e886c3853febe3985b0d612c8889fa2ee38e860b1d6744f5c744f"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"IANA 的工作主要分为三部分：DNS 根区、互联网号码资源，以及协议参数注册表。它们分别为域名解析、地址分配和软件互通提供共同依据。","id":"01a1a144-0f0f-79c7-873f-95cbf49f4936","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"IANA 的工作主要分为三部分：DNS 根区、互联网号码资源，以及协议参数注册表。它们分别为域名解析、地址分配和软件互通提供共同依据。","start":595,"end":662,"quoteHash":"7c6117faa2b68af013207878a88e0c09e799d5888b95e0b9b74424812ef0e7c9"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"1. DNS 根区管理","id":"01a1a144-0f0f-75b6-84ae-efb45232c2ad","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"1. DNS 根区管理","start":664,"end":675,"quoteHash":"956f4dbdda6fe1d0da9314d2940ed8e900d815a3b9ef03819d5face9f851a388"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"DNS 将人们熟悉的域名转换为计算机可以使用的信息。位于这一体系顶层的 DNS 根区，记录 .com、.net、.org 和国家或地区代码顶级域等的委派信息。","id":"01a1a144-0f0f-7b9a-9a97-5baf7572c7fb","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"DNS 将人们熟悉的域名转换为计算机可以使用的信息。位于这一体系顶层的 DNS 根区，记录 .com、.net、.org 和国家或地区代码顶级域等的委派信息。","start":677,"end":756,"quoteHash":"74787d3cca9e206e7d63eab2608fe7386d78fd109f935fc814c65653f5eca37e"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"IANA 处理这些委派及相关技术资料的变更。根区数据库列出了顶级域管理机构及相关记录。其域名职能还包括 .int、.arpa、根区 DNSSEC 密钥工作，以及国际化域名相关资源。","id":"01a1a144-0f0f-76e0-acd9-d2128d1544ae","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"IANA 处理这些委派及相关技术资料的变更。根区数据库列出了顶级域管理机构及相关记录。其域名职能还包括 .int、.arpa、根区 DNSSEC 密钥工作，以及国际化域名相关资源。","start":758,"end":848,"quoteHash":"e4361cee1ad842bb07c6393bc5ebdd53b731b91bb23cb6e4c8148bf12b7d9db1"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1},{"questionKey":"q1","kind":"fact","text":"IANA 维护 IPv4、IPv6 和 ASN 的全球注册记录。在分配体系的顶层，它将可分配的号码资源池分配给五家区域互联网注册管理机构（RIR），再由 RIR 在各自服务区域内办理资源分配和登记。","id":"01a1a144-0f10-7467-be13-6230750e8285","supports":[{"sourceId":"01a1a143-9b16-7e5a-b66b-af3105f15746","quote":"IANA 维护 IPv4、IPv6 和 ASN 的全球注册记录。在分配体系的顶层，它将可分配的号码资源池分配给五家区域互联网注册管理机构（RIR），再由 RIR 在各自服务区域内办理资源分配和登记。","start":1044,"end":1143,"quoteHash":"b70f14772875d6a5b64220a115399a1ec6cac44fbf020d1cc63c7dbc853f8768"}],"opposes":[],"distinctSourceGroups":1}]}